{"id":2075,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><style></style><div><p>为充分发挥青年榜样的示范引领作用，激励全校青年学子笃志勤学、踔厉奋发，校团委组织开展了2025年度“校园十大青年人物”评选活动。按照公平、公正、公开的原则，经学生自主申请、学院审核推荐、现场答辩等环节，现将评审结果公示如下：</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gozALRLRU4MRV2UMmNZM7U4LmLDMRfo7nmffLNrkMmQkM490gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDM1hfM1yZUmLPozr7nR-inl78oRVRU4C8U4f2UzfVoRQFM7-sMzUPU8VFLlW7nR-Jv2bjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4LYysLmUagtA8pUucc&oid=1366454638&tid=1033&nid=7240&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/666A68B3195DD25EA481CC64C0FA0E86/4B7541CA/1BDD2\" vheight=\"468.4700012207031\" vwidth=\"376.4700012207031\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gozALRLRU4MRV2UMmNZM7U4LmLDMRfo7nmffLNrkMmQkM490gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDM1hfM1yZUmLPozr7nR-inl78oRVRU4C8U4f2UzfVoRQFM7-sMzUPU8VFLlW7nR-Jv2bjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4LYysLmUagtA8pUucc&oid=1366454638&tid=1033&nid=7240&e=.png\"></p><p>公示期为5个工作日（自2026年4月7日至2026年4月13日）。如有异议，请以书面或电话等方式向校团委反映。反映意见要求实名，内容客观真实，以便核实。</p><p>联系人：王老师</p><p>联系电话：3922042</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"https://tw.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gozALRLRU4MRV2UMmNZM7U4LmLDMRfo7nmffLNrkMmQkM490gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDM1hfM1yZUmLPozr7nR-inl78oRVRU4C8U4f2UzfVoRQFM7-sMzUPU8VFLlW7nR-Jv2bjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4LYysLmUagtA8pUucc&oid=1366454638&tid=1033&nid=7240&e=.png"}